"seekdir - set the position of the next readdir() call in the directory "
"stream."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/seekdir.3:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<void seekdir(DIR *>I<dirp>B<, long >I<loc>B<);>\n"
